// keyword_taxonomy.dl — §702 keyword -> ability-class, generated from rules.txt.
// spaCy parses "[Keyword] is a [type] ability"; a verb-group classifier handles the rest
// (represents/special-kind/appears-on/found-on). Facts are GENERATED, not hand-written.

